          }
        ],
        "text": "JUSTICE KENNEDY: \"Well, could the government, I assume -- I assume you will say \\\"yes\\\" -- could the government forbid any NGO or other organization or person from giving tsunami aid to one of these organizations, from giving them money?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
