          }
        ],
        "text": "JUSTICE SCALIA: \"Why do you say Congress clearly did not intend that? You know, I would have guessed that you are providing a service or personnel when you make yourself a member of the organization. Why do you say Congress clearly did not intend it?\""
      },
      {
