            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, \"If O'Brien applies, what remains of your case?\""
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "3ad62dc4846c552344a5f448fce4bd723e7c72509cac6ba04faf6667fda1cb68",
